OL,3,GNEWSABogus bailiff left victim feeling
OL,4,A'like he was having a heart attack'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former MP thought he was going to
OL,7,Fhave a heart attack after being
OL,8,Ftargeted by a scammer pretending to be
OL,9,Fa bailiff.
OL,11,FHuw Edwards, who served as Labour MP
OL,12,Ffor Monmouth from 1997 to 2005, was
OL,13,Fdriving to a meeting when he received a
OL,14,Fphone call telling him he owed #860 to
OL,15,Fa debt collection agency.
OL,17,FEdwards and his wife eventually
OL,18,Festablished it was a scam after
OL,19,Fspeaking to a friend in the insolvency
OL,20,Fbusiness.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
